    "| c2 t50 | **2.5–3.4 m** even when the forecast TWL is below 0.5 m; setup 2.1–3.5 m | runup line found on the wrong feature (wet/dry line, wrack, dune toe) | `implausible` and in `EXCLUDE` |\n",
