    "but it is a resolution limit, not an error.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Old-CSV mean elevations were contaminated by the zero placeholders**: on several transects the mean runup sat *below* tide +\n",
    "surge at high tide (negative setup), because samples of 0.000 m were averaged in. Removing them in cell 2 fixes this.\n",
    "\n",
    "The table and plots below repeat these checks on the current CSV, so they update when you regenerate it:\n",
    "- `clipped`, `implausible`: share of bursts flagged.\n",
